<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">- Kuturikihwa kwoBhaibheri muchiKorekore</book>
  <para style="h">1 VaThesaronika</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tsamba raPhauro ku1 vaThesaronika</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 VaThesaronika</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 VaThe</para>
  <para style="mt2">Tsamba Rokuthanga raPhauro</para>
  <para style="mt1">kuvaTHESARONIKA</para>
  <para style="imt">Kuwidzira</para>
  <para style="ip">Tsamba rokuthanga kuvaThesaronika ridonyohwa noNhumwa Phauro (vaThesaronika 1:1) Rinogona kunge riri tsamba rokuthanga ridonyohwa naPhauro richizova chikamu choBhaibhiri futi ridonyohwa kumakore yanenge makumi mashano noribodzi mumasure mokuzvahwa kwaKhirisitu. Phauro wanga ari kuKorinde paadonyora tsamba rakareri kukherekhe yokuThesaronika, inova kherekhe yaadothanga pahwendo hwache hwoushumiri hwochipiri (Mabasa 17:1-10). Zvinonyaihwa mubhuku raMabasa kuti kherekhe yakareyo yanga inonhengo dzochiJudha novoyamwe marudzi vadowanda chaizvo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mumasure mokuthanga kherekhe muThesaronika, Phauro adogonaba kugara nguwa idorepha makaremo, saka adodzotumira tsamba rakareri kuti asimbise vatendi. Tsamba racho rinobata nyaya dzidowanda futi rinowidzira zvinhu zvidosiyana siyana pamusoro pokurarama kunofanira kuitiwa nomaKhirisitu. Phauro anoisa pfungwa pakuuya kwochipiri kwaKhirisitu. Zvinogona kureva kuti vatendi vokherekhe yokuThesaronika vaiva nochido chikuru pamusoro ponyaya yakarei. Phauro adoshandisa nyaya yokudzoka kwaKhirisitu kuti avakurudzire kurarama zvinofadza Mwari. (1vaThesaronika 5:6-8).</para>
  <para style="iot">Marongehwo</para>
  <para style="io1">Phauro anothanga tsamba rakareri achimoresa kherekhe nokupasa kutenda kuna Mwari pamusaka povatendi (1 vaThesaronika 1:1-10).</para>
  <para style="io1">Zvino anodzotsanangura pamusoro pomaitiro yache nopamusoro ponyaya idouya naTimoti kwaari (1vaThesaronika 2:1—3:13).</para>
  <para style="io1">Zvinotevera nzvokuti Phauro anoraira kuti maKhirisitu vanofanira kugara tini apo vanonangarana nokuuya kwochipiri kwaJesu (1vaThesaronika 4:1—5:15).</para>
  <para style="io1">Phauro anopedzisa nokumoresa kherekhe pakare futi achikumbira kuti munhu wese mukherekhe averenge tsamba yakarei (1vaThesaronika 5:16-28).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />Phauro, naSirivhanasi, naTimoti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Kukherekhe yovaThesaronika, muna Mwari Baba naIshe Jesu Khirisitu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Mutsa norugare mbazvive kwamuri.<verse eid="1TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Upenyu noKutenda kwovaThesaronika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />Tinopasa kutenda kuna Mwari nguwa dzese nokuda kwenyu mese, patinombondotaura pamusoro penyu muminamato yedu, <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" />patinorangarira pamberi paMwari Baba vedu, basa renyu rokutenda nokushanda kworudo nokutsungirira kwotariro muna Ishe wedu Jesu Khirisitu. <verse eid="1TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />Hama dzinodiwa naMwari tinoziva, kuti adokusarudzai, <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" />nokuti vhangeri redu harinai kuuya kwamuri mumashoko basi, asi mumasimba nomuMweya Mutsvene pakare nokuuyisa kugutsikana kuzere. Munoziva kuti tanga tiri vanhu vadoita tini pataiva pakati penyu tichizviitira imimi. <verse eid="1TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" />Futi mudova vateedzeri vedu novaIshe, nondava yokuti mudotambira shoko mukutambudzika kukuru, muno mufaro udofemehwa naMweya Mutsvene, <verse eid="1TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" />zvokutoti mudova muenzaniso kuvatendi vese vomuMasedhoniya nomuAkaya. <verse eid="1TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />Nokuti shoko raIshe harinai kundonzvika kubva kwamuri richienda kuMakedhoniya nokuAkaya basi, asi kutenda kwenyu muna Mwari kudoenda kwese kwese, zvokutoti panodiwaba kuti tinyaire chinhu. <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" />Nokuti ivo pachavo vanonyaira pamusoro pomatambiriro yamudotiita, nomapindukiro yamudoita kuna Mwari muchibva kuzvifananidzo, kuti mushumire Mwari mupenyu nowochokwadi, <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" />futi kuti mumirire Mwanakomana wache kubva kudenga, waadomutsa kubva kuvadopfa, iye Jesu anotidzikinura kubva kuukari hunouya.<verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Basa raPhauro muThesaronika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />Nokuti imimi hama pachenyu munozviziva, kuti kuuya kwedu kwamuri kwanga kusiri kundouyawo kusina basa. <verse eid="1TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" />Asi kunyange tidotambudzika kare nokubatiwa uyanga muFiripi, sezvamunoziva, tidova nokutsungirira muna Mwari wedu kukuudzai vhangeri yaMwari tidonangarana nokupikisiwa kukuru. <verse eid="1TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />Nokuti kukumbira kwatinoita hakubve pakutaika kana pautsambwa kana kubva pauchenjeri hokubiridzira. <verse eid="1TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" />Asi sezvatidotendehwa naMwari kuvimbiwa novhangeri, saka tinonyaira, aikona kuti tifadze vanhu, asi Mwari anoongorora mwoyo yedu. <verse eid="1TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" />Nokuti hatinai kushandisa kunyaira kwodzvene kana kuvharidzira nhafu, sezvamunoziva, Mwari ndiye pfakazi yedu, <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" />kana kuti tidombotsvaga kupembedzewa novanhu, kungave kubva kwamuri kana kubva kunovamwewo, <verse eid="1TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />kunyange tingave tidoraira senhumwa dzaKhirisitu. Asi tanga tiri vanyoro pakati penyu, kunge amai vanorera vana vavo. <verse eid="1TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />Saka tidoita hanya naimimi, ndava tidokuditsai. Tidofarira kukovana nemi, aikona vhangeri raMwari chete asi noupenyu hwedu pakare nokuti matova vadikani kwatiri. <verse eid="1TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />Chokwadi hama munoyeuka kushanda kwedu tidoshanda masikati nousiku kuti tireke kuremedza umwe wenyu, pataiparidza kwamuri vhangeri raMwari.<verse eid="1TH 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />Imimi muri pfakazi, naMwari pakare, kuti utsvene hwai nokururama nokusaya chipomehwa kwanga kuri paunhu hwedu kwamuri vatendi. <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11" />Ndava munoziva kuti sababa novana vavo, <verse eid="1TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12" />tidonyaradza umwe noumwe wenyu nokukukurudzirai nokukushingisai kuti murarame upenyu hudokodzera pamberi paMwari, anokudaidzirai kuumambo hwache nokubhwinya.<verse eid="1TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />Futi tinoramba tichitenda Mwari nondava yokuti pamudotambira shoko raMwari ramudonzva kwatiri, mudoribvuma aikona kunge shoko rovanhu asi sezvariri chaizvo, kuti ndaMwari, rinotova pabasa mamuri vanotenda. <verse eid="1TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" />Nokuti imimi, hama, mudova vateedzeri vomakherekhe yaMwari yomuJudhiya yari muna Khirisitu Jesu. Mudotambudziwa novanhu venyu pazvinhu zvibodzizvo zvidotambudza makherekhe zvichiitiwa nomaJudha <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15" />vanova ndivo vadobaya Ishe Jesu novaporofiti, nokutibiritsa kunze. Futi vanofadzaba Mwari pakare vanotsvatsvana novanhu vese <verse eid="1TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16" />pakutitadzisa kutaura kumamwe marudzi kuti vaponesewe. Pamaitiro yakareya vanozazisa chiyero chozvitadzo zvavo. Asi manje pakupedzisira ukari hwaMwari hwadzouya pamusoro pavo!<verse eid="1TH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chido chaPhauro Chokuvabvakachira Pakare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />Asi hama dzangu, zvatidopararanisiwa naimimi, kwokanguwa kapfupi, pamutumbi aikona pamwoyo, tinoedza zvidokungudza nochido chikuru kuti tionane naimimi chiso nochiso; <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />ndava taida kuuya kwamuri inipano, Phauro, kadowanditsako, asi Sathani adotivharidzira. <verse eid="1TH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" />Nokuti tariro yedu njipi kana mufaro kana korona yokuzvirumbidza pamberi paIshe wedu Jesu paanouya? Handiti ndimi? <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />Nokuti ndimi kukudziwa kwedu nomufaro wedu.<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1" />Naizvozvo patidotadza kutsungirira pazviri, tidoda kusiiwa tega paAtene, <verse eid="1TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2" />futi tidotuma Timoti, hama yedu nomuranda waMwari muvhangeri raKhirisitu, kuti akusimbisei nokukukurudzirai mukutenda kwenyu, <verse eid="1TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" />kuti pareke kuva noanozunguziwa nomatambudziko yakareya. Imipa pachenyu munoziva kuti tidotemehwa zvakarezvi. <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" />Nokuti pataiva naimimi, tidogara takunyepai kuti taidzodzimbiwa nomatambudziko, fanike zvidodzoitika, futi sezvamunoziva. <verse eid="1TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />Nochikonzero chakarechi, pandanga ndichakonaba kushingirira, ndidomutuma kuti ndizive kutenda kwenyu, nokuti ndaichira kuti dzimwe nguwa muedzi adokuedzai ndokukonzera basa redu kuti rive pasina.<verse eid="1TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" />Asi zvino Timoti paadouya achibva kwamuri, adotiunzira nhau dzidonaka dzokutenda kwenyu norudo futi adotiudza kuti munombondotifunga uye muchisuva kutiona, sezvatinosuvawo kukuonai. <verse eid="1TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" />Nochikonzero chakarechi, hama, pakushushikana kwedu kwese nokutambudzika tanga tichinyaradziwa pamusoro penyu kuburikidza nokutenda kwenyu, <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />nokuti zvino tinorarama, kana mukamira mudosimba muna Ishe. <verse eid="1TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />Tingatende tini Mwari zvidokwana nondava yenyu nokuda kwomufaro watinawo pamberi pache pamusaka penyu? <verse eid="1TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />Tinonamata zvidoperera masikati nousiku kuti tikuonei pakare nokukupasai zviri kusaika mukutenda kwenyu.<verse eid="1TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />Zvino dai Mwari wedu ivo Baba pachavo, naIshe wedu Jesu, watungamirira nzira yedu kwamuri. <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />Dai Ishe waita kuti rudo renyu rikukumuke nokupfachukira pakati penyu nokuvanhu vese, kunge zvatinoita kwamuri. <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" />Dai Ishe wasimbisa mwoyo yenyu kuti musaye chamunonenehwa muri vatsvene pamberi paMwari naBaba vedu, pakuuya kwaIshe wedu Jesu novatsvene vache vese.<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="s">Upenyu Hunofadza Mwari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />Pakupedzisira, hama, tinokumbiritsa nokukutetererai muna Ishe Jesu, kuti sezvamudodzidza kwatiri magariro yamunofanira kuita nokufadza Mwari, sezvamuri kundoita, nyanyitsai kuita zvakarezvo. <verse eid="1TH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2" />Nokuti munoziva kuti kuraira kwatidokupasai pamusoro paIshe Jesu nghupi. <verse eid="1TH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3" />Nokuti ikoku ndiko kuda kwaMwari, kuva kwenyu noutsvene, kuti mutsemberefuti upombwe, <verse eid="1TH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4" />kuti umwe noumwe adzidze kuzvibata panyama yache muutsvene futi zvinoremekedzeka, <verse eid="1TH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5" />aikona mukubatiwa nokuchiva kunge vadotaika vasingazive Mwari, <verse eid="1TH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />kuti pareke kuva noanotadzira hama yache pachinhu chakarechi kana kuita dzawira mutsvanda kuhama kana hanzvadzi. Ndava Ishe ndiye mutsiidzi pazvinhu zvese zvakarezvi, sezvatidogara takuchenjedzai zvidosimba. <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" />Nokuti Mwari haanai kutidaidzira kuutsambwa, asi kuupenyu hutsvene. <verse eid="1TH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" />Naizvozvo wese anoshora zvakarezvi, anoshoraba munhu asi Mwari, anopasa Mweya Mutsvene wache kwamuri.<verse eid="1TH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />Zvino pamusoro pokuda hama hapanai wamungade kuti akunyorerei, ndava imimi pachenyu mudodzidzisiwa naMwari kuti mudanane, <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />futi ndizvozvo chaizvo munoda hama dzese kuMakedhoniya kwese. Asi hama tinokukurudzirai, kuti muite daipo muchitoingidzira pakare, <verse eid="1TH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" />kuti mude kugara mudodekhara, muchifunga pamusoro pozvinhu zvenyu mega basi, nokushanda nomanja yenyu, sezvatidokurairai. <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" />Kuti pakurarama kwenyu muzvitorere kuremekedzewa novokunze, futi musingavimbe noumwe munhu.<verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuuya kwaIshe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13" />Asi hama, tinodaba kuti musaye nzeru pamusoro povaye vadopfa, kuti mureke kuita maririro yanenge yovamwe vasinai tariro. <verse eid="1TH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14" />Nokuti tinotenda kuti Jesu adopfa ndokumuka pakamu, ndomwenzewo kamu, kuburikidza naJesu, Mwari achaunza vadopfa maari pabodzi naye.<verse eid="1TH 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" />Nokuti tinokunyepai zvakarezvi noshoko raIshe, kuti isisu vapuma, vadosara kusvikira pakuuya kwaIshe, hatithangire vaye vadopfa. <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />Nokuti Ishe pachake achaburuka kubva kudenga achidaidzira nokuraira, nokusheedzera kwongirozi ikuru, nokurira kwotsuri yaMwari. Ipopo vadopfa muna Khirisitu vachathanga kumuka, <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" />zvino isisu tidosara tiri vapuma, tichabvutiwa pabodzi navo kupinda mumakuti kuti tikumane naIshe mumhepo. Saka tichava naIshe nguwa dzese. <verse eid="1TH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />Naizvozvo nyaradzanai nomashoko yakareya.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="s">Gadzirirai Kuuya kwaIshe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />Zvino hama, pamusoro ponguwa nomwaka, hapanai chinhu chamungade kuti munyorehwe. <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" />Nokuti imimi pachenyu munonatsa kuziva kuti zuva raIshe richauya kunge mbavha usiku. <verse eid="1TH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" />Vanhu pavanoti, “Kuno runyararo nokudekharika,” pakarepo kuparadziwa ndopakunouya pavari chivhurumukihwa kunge kudzimbiwa kwomukadzi waakuda kupona, futi panenge pasinai kupukunyuka. <verse eid="1TH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />Asi hama, hamuzi murima, kuti zuva rakarero rikushamisei kunge mbavha, <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" />nokuti mese muri vanakomana vochiedza futi vanakomana vomasikati. Hatisi vousiku kana vorima. <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />Saka mbatirekei kuenzera, fanike zvinoitiwa novamwe, asi mbatirambei tidopenya futi tidobanganuka. <verse eid="1TH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />Ndava vaye vanoenzera, vanoenzera usiku, novaye vanokorewa, vanokorewa usiku. <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" />Asi, zvatiri vomasikati, mbatipepukei, tipfeke chivharidziro chopachipfuwa chokutenda norudo, futi mbative nongundu youtare yotariro yoruponiso. <verse eid="1TH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />Nokuti Mwari haanai kutitemera ukari, asi kutiwanisa ruponiso kuburikidza naIshe wedu Jesu Khirisitu, <verse eid="1TH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" />iye adotipfira kuti kunyange tichirarama kana kupfa tive vanogara maari. <verse eid="1TH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />Naizvozvo kurudziranai nokuvakhana, sezvamuri kundoita.<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuraira kwoKupedzisira noKumoresana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />Asi tinokukumbiritsai, hama, kuti muremekedze vaye vari kushanda pakati penyu ivo vari pamusoro penyu muna Ishe vanokurairai, <verse eid="1TH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />nokuvaremekedza zvidonyanya murudo nokuda kwobasa ravo. Ivai norunyararo pakati penyu.<verse eid="1TH 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" />Futi tinokukurudzirai, hama, dzumai vanonungo, kurudzirai vanoita chinepfu, batsirai vadoneta, itirai vese mwoyo murefu. <verse eid="1TH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" />Onai kuti hapanai wenyu anotsiva chidoipa nochidoipa, asi nguwa dzese tsvagai kuitirana zvidonaka nokunovese.<verse eid="1TH 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />Farai nguwa dzese, <verse eid="1TH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" />rambai muchinamata, <verse eid="1TH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" />pasai kutenda mumamiriro yese yozvinhu, nokuti kwakareku ndiko kuda kwaMwari pamusoro penyu muna Khirisitu Jesu.<verse eid="1TH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" />Regai kudzimwa Mweya, <verse eid="1TH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />regai kushora kuporofita, <verse eid="1TH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" />asi edzai zvinhu zvese, batitsitsai zvidonaka, <verse eid="1TH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />rambai mishoo yese yozvidoipa.<verse eid="1TH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />Dai Mwari worunyararo pachake wakuitai vatsvene zvidozara, futi dai mweya wenyu nomwoyo nomuviri zvachengetewa zviri njinjinji pasinai chinoshoreka panouya Ishe wedu Jesu Khirisitu. <verse eid="1TH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" />Iye anokudaidzai adovimbika, futi achazviita.<verse eid="1TH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />Hama, tinamatireiwo.<verse eid="1TH 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />Moresai hama dzese nokutsvodana kutsvene.<verse eid="1TH 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />Ndinokurairai naIshe kuti tsamba yakarei iverengewe kuhama dzese.<verse eid="1TH 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />Mutsa waIshe wedu Jesu Khirisitu mbauve naimimi.<verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5" />
</usx>